TDT -> Test driven testing -> Testing/ Writing testcase before development of functionality
BDT -> behaviour driven testing -> Testing/Writing testcase after development of functionality.

TDT is used in projects/application which are getting built from scratch
BDT is used in projects/ application which are up and running and have some enhancements done

Advantage
TDT -> if testcases are written before then during development developers can refer them while developing functionality
this will make sure the basic functionality is working and it also leads to having less bug detection
BDT -> as this is used for application which is running and have some enhancement done this requires retesting of existing functionality
along with new enhancement testing.